I guess it may be possible similarly with expected.test() function and EAPsum method of the fscores() function. Conceptually, it calls 'recursive formula' for what matches among raw scale score and IRT scale observed-score. In advance, see this <https://books.google.co.kr/books?id=AzO5BAAAQBAJ&pg=PA232&lpg=PA232&dq=recursive+formula+IRT&source=bl&ots=u_fWHzDgk6&sig=DK4No8af9oexzHYX5aeeGJM46vk&hl=ko&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwig6b6QxanSAhULVrwKHc7FDbwQ6AEIHjAA#v=onepage&q=recursive%20formula%20IRT&f=false>.

Seongho

